		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gargantuan dragonkin. Hydra heads encircling a giant tubular maw. Tail has a giant crab claw.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite (near) +6 (1d8) and 1 maw +6 (2d10) and 1 claw (near) +6 (1d8 + grab), <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Heads</strong>. Choose how many heads the hydra has. Each is LV 2, AC 15, HP 11, and can make 1 bite attack. A killed head sprouts into two new heads at the start of the hydra's turn unless cauterized beforehand. The hydra's LV is all the heads combined.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
